[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2962132860","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107374#issuecomment-2962132860","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107374","id":2962132860,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wjo98","user":{"login":"rburing","id":229837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTgzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing","html_url":"https://github.com/rburing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-11T10:29:54Z","updated_at":"2025-06-11T10:29:54Z","body":"There *is* overlap with the origin, because you create the body at the origin:\n\n```gdscript\nvar resource : Resource = load(\"res://character.tscn\")\ncharacter = resource.instantiate()\nadd_child(character)\ncharacter.position = get_local_mouse_position()\n```\n\nYou should create it directly at the intended position instead, by swapping the last two lines:\n\n```gdscript\nvar resource : Resource = load(\"res://character.tscn\")\ncharacter = resource.instantiate()\ncharacter.position = get_local_mouse_position()\nadd_child(character)\n```\n\nThis fixes the issue.\n\nThis caveat could be documented better.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2962132860/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2962265215","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107374#issuecomment-2962265215","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107374","id":2962265215,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wkJR_","user":{"login":"The5-2","id":66440895,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NDQwODk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66440895?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/The5-2","html_url":"https://github.com/The5-2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The5-2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The5-2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The5-2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The5-2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The5-2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The5-2/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The5-2/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The5-2/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/The5-2/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-11T11:09:23Z","updated_at":"2025-06-11T11:09:23Z","body":"@rburing  Thanks for the qick response. Just verified it, it works once I swap the lines.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2962265215/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]